@gideon.sato: Your first report in #inc-vtg-hartford was at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug (ts 1785771720.000104): "gate kiosks offline at Vantorre's Hartford plant," with both inbound lanes showing a white screen after badge scan.

In the meantime, per your own 10:42 post, the guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard. The channel also shows that Mateo reported six trucks waiting at the east gate at 10:44. Kiosk 1 came back at 11:03, when the guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch saw it. You posted that both lanes were working at 11:07 AM.

The channel doesn't record anything else the guard did, so the clipboard detail is the only account of that period.
